//|                       reloads the magic-scoped GlobalVariables   |
//|                       they persist                               |
//|   shared, symbol-keyed (market level): spread, slippage and      |
//|                       outcome rings - one market for every engine|
//|                                                                  |
//| ONE FILE = THE WHOLE EA: all 65 strategies are inlined           |
//| below, so nothing from portfolio-EA/ has to ship next to it.     |
//| It uses the same shared engine header as the 65 delivered EAs:   |
